      "content": "I see. So the government is the \"status quo\" and the others are just protesters. But some reports say the opposition is actually trying to stage a coup or something, which sounds way more dangerous for a tourist than just some protests. Is the unrest being driven by legitimate political disagreement, or is it more about these groups trying to forcibly destabilize the country? I just want to know if the \"unrest\" is just chaos or if there's a specific agenda that might target high-end areas.",
